{"id":"vod_bf_1794","vodId":"1794","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"白色相簿第二季","name_cn":"白色相簿第二季","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-2/103428d7f89083883140c0f78fcb6e37.jpg"},"summary":"时值2007年的秋天，北原春希（水岛大宙 配音）是一位就读于峰城大学附属学园的平凡高中三年级学生，为了替自己的高中生活划下完美的句号，春希加入了轻音乐同好社团。可是，惨淡的经营让这个本就默默无闻的社团几近崩溃，春希的美好愿望眼看着就要破灭。　　一次偶然中，正在独自弹奏吉他的春希突然听到一段美妙的歌声，追寻着这声音，一个名叫小木曽雪菜（米泽円 配音）的女生出现在了春希的面前。雪菜是学校里的偶像人物，之后，雪菜经由春希的邀请加入了轻音部。紧接着加入的是能够弹奏一手好钢琴的女生冬马和纱（生天目仁美 配音），和纱的叛逆和不羁人尽皆知，可即便如此，春希还是热忱地邀请了和纱“入伙”。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 16:31:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baisexiangbudierji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baisexiangbudierji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baisexiangbudierji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baisexiangbudierji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baisexiangbudierji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baisexiangbudierji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baisexiangbudierji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baisexiangbudierji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baisexiangbudierji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baisexiangbudierji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baisexiangbudierji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baisexiangbudierji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/baisexiangbudierji/第13集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotA